OL,4,BA 'wow' player - why Ngumoha is        
OL,5,Balready a Liverpool game-changer       
OL,6,GRio Ngumoha is going to be a 'wow'     
OL,7,Gplayer for Liverpool - and he showed   
OL,8,Geveryone exactly what he is already    
OL,9,Gcapable of in Sunday's 4-0 win over    
OL,10,GManchester United.                     
OL,12,FHe made an outstanding assist then     
OL,13,Fadded a fine finish, and there is much 
OL,14,Fmore to come. He plays without fear so 
OL,15,Fhe is going to score and make many     
OL,16,Fmore goals the same way.               
OL,18,FNgumoha has only just turned 18 but he 
OL,19,Fis already a game-changer, someone who 
OL,20,Fgets people excited because he is so   
OL,21,Fhard to stop when he is one-on-one.    
